50-38.png", "id": "1656241452300629", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620497_1656241455633962_1407169858112240986_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NN6V-l_WbqEQ7kNvwGvZeiR&_nc_oc=AdooEYkG-ezK3CWVvsZkHnflWf-wp1O8lXeGW_GOicH2e6VhHcU5YFbYy7Nxz-gJrwM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO9EeESvCxW93yxKFRh1eMyQyTLCaY-0-MuW_SALWrh4w&oe=6AC7AE6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Monkey Dudes!", "keywords": ["tag", "gorilla", "monkeydudes", "fangame", "horror"], "long_description": "Welcome to Monkey Dudes!\n\nRun, climb and explore a multiplayer monkey world built for playing with friends and meeting new players.\n\nExplore different areas including Forest, PvP, Horror, Pool, Shop and more, each with something different to do. Race around, battle other players, explore scary areas or just hang out.\n\n\u2022 Multiplayer monkey movement\n\u2022 PvP battles\n\u2022 Horror areas\n\u2022 Multiple maps to explore\n\u2022 Cosmetics and shops\n\u2022 Play and hang out with friends\n\u2022 New content and updates\n\nGrab your headset, become a Monkey Dude and jump in!", "short_description": "Run, climb, explore, battle and hang out with friends in Monkey Dudes! Discover tons of maps including Forest, PvP, Horror, Pool, Shop and more. Jump in, meet other players and see what you can find!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkey-dudes/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Troy Dev", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkeydudes/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_t